knext bundled fix for vinext 1.1.0 (dist output)
Upstream: https://github.com/cloudflare/vinext/pull/3763 (issue https://github.com/cloudflare/vinext/issues/3762)
What it fixes: with `experimental.inlineCss: true`, a Nitro build (vinext() + nitro(), the knext
scaffold on both the bun and node presets) still rendered `<link rel="stylesheet">` tags (Next.js
deploy test `app-inline-css`). The `vinext:inline-css-manifest` plugin read the client CSS from a
hard-coded `dist/client` and injected the manifest into a hard-coded `dist/server`, but Nitro
writes the client to `.output/public` and the RSC entry under `node_modules/.nitro/vite/services/rsc`,
so the manifest was empty and `globalThis.__VINEXT_INLINE_CSS__` was never set. Both directories
now come from the resolved environment config (client `build.outDir`, top-level
`environments.rsc.build.outDir`, then `rscOutDir`, then `dist/server` as before). The client
`closeBundle` runs before Nitro bundles its server, so the manifest reaches
`.output/server/index.mjs`. Applies on top of every earlier patch in manifest order.
Retire: delete this file (and its manifest entry) when the pinned vinext is >= the first
release that includes cloudflare/vinext#3763.
Ported by hand from the upstream src change to the published 1.1.0 dist file.
Applied by `knext vinext-patches` (runs from the app's postinstall and before `knext build`).

--- a/dist/index.js
+++ b/dist/index.js
@@ -4100,9 +4100,9 @@
 					const envConfig = this.environment?.config;
 					if (!envConfig) return;
 					const buildRoot = envConfig.root ?? process.cwd();
-					const clientDir = path.resolve(buildRoot, "dist", "client");
+					const clientDir = path.resolve(buildRoot, envConfig.build.outDir);
 					const manifest = collectInlineCssManifest(clientDir, nextConfig.assetPrefix);
-					const rscOutDir = path.resolve(buildRoot, options.rscOutDir ?? path.join("dist", "server"));
+					const rscOutDir = path.resolve(buildRoot, this.environment.getTopLevelConfig().environments.rsc?.build.outDir ?? options.rscOutDir ?? path.join("dist", "server"));
 					for (const entryFile of ["index.js", "index.mjs"]) if (injectInlineCssManifestGlobal(path.join(rscOutDir, entryFile), manifest)) break;
 				}
 			}
